      "cooked": "<p>Tachyon meets up with new heroes and villains on her home turf. It’s Argo the adaptive android  against Super Scientific Tachyon, Johnny Rocket, Raven, Bowman and Lady Liberty admist Freedom Tower.<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/6855b45e6bfdc7ec6fc6fdf14197f9e17d6398aa.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/6855b45e6bfdc7ec6fc6fdf14197f9e17d6398aa\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6855b45e6bfdc7ec6fc6fdf14197f9e17d6398aa_2_231x500.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"eSZhf3SjfMkFas122b0sY6hCu8y\" width=\"231\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6855b45e6bfdc7ec6fc6fdf14197f9e17d6398aa_2_231x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6855b45e6bfdc7ec6fc6fdf14197f9e17d6398aa_2_346x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6855b45e6bfdc7ec6fc6fdf14197f9e17d6398aa_2_462x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/6/6855b45e6bfdc7ec6fc6fdf14197f9e17d6398aa_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">828×1792 126 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nWith this many heroes around, you’d think Argo would have more powers to acquire, but perhaps the AI couldn’t handle all the attention. Fairly straightforward with Argo kept on his front side the whole game and quickly taken down. And with two speedsters, quickly was the only way this fight was happening.</p>",
