      "created_at": "2023-05-17T16:28:44.236Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I got stalled briefly because I didn’t deal with the healing imprints, which meant Argo was recovering 12 HP per turn for a bit and built himself up to a flip; as soon as he did, though, he collapsed.</p>\n<p>I got cocky after using Tachyon’s turn to burn through a hilarious number of cards for Johnny Rocket, who benefits immensely from her experiments. I almost expected to get Argo down on Turn 2, but Johnny slowed down after that and Argo got his healing together.</p>",
